<title>FRANCE: Air France Europe net loss 448 mln Ffr in 1996/97.</title>
<headline>Air France Europe net loss 448 mln Ffr in 1996/97.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				   loss     488  vs   loss    321</p>
<p>    Turnover				    11,282  vs	  10,913</p>
<p>    Gross operating surplus		    100  vs	     694</p>
<p>    Amortization and provision charges     835  vs	   1,075</p>
<p>    Operating result		  loss     735  vs   loss    381</p>
<p>    Net financial charges			 19  vs		60</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional	loss     754  vs   loss    441</p>
<p>    Exceptional gains			    266  vs	     120</p>
<p>NOTE: Air France Europe, a subsidiary which is due to fully merge this year with parent Air France, released its results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
